    ],
    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Verifies that {@link StringSubstitutor} handles a variable whose key is unknown but which supplies an inline default value (the {@code ${key:-default}} syntax). <p>The template mixes three cases:</p> <ul> <li>{@code ${person}} &mdash; an unknown key with no default, so it is left untouched.</li> <li>{@code ${target}} &mdash; a known key, so it is replaced with its mapped value.</li> <li>{@code ${undefined.number:-1234567890}} &mdash; an unknown key with a default, so the default value is substituted.</li> </ul>"
   },
   {
    "id": "i2",
